{
"file": 20,
"paths": [
"d002/f619"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "9b459ae9",
"en_raw": "Triplet ghosts?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "f512b877",
"en_raw": "Red, blue, yellow?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "2c304951",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "b2cec629",
"en_raw": "who told you that?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "563b0fa6",
"en_raw": "Come to the staff room, I'd say"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "93fccbaa",
"en_raw": "Right, right, and so"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "e0ff393c",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to go to the sandbox"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "9bd9d325",
"en_raw": "She's not listening at all"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "ef1dc095",
"en_raw": "That's so Shiina, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "5dd9f8b5",
"en_raw": "A fun rumor, too"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a4b6fa64",
"en_raw": "Yeah, and so"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "4e2b7638",
"en_raw": "The red kid is covered in blood"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1b7d358d",
"en_raw": "The blue kid has no blood"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "596a367d",
"en_raw": "The yellow kid is... what was it?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "e39695cb",
"en_raw": "Ha ha, true"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "b9405573",
"en_raw": "It does sound like a fun rumor"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b6a3fe0c",
"en_raw": "...So that's the story"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "5c5fb880",
"en_raw": "The park under the overpass, huh..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "75117d74",
"en_raw": "Well, maybe that's fine"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "fcadda75",
"en_raw": "Okay, let's go check it out"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "91b34451",
"en_raw": "Yay"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "aa817a3f",
"en_raw": "What are you checking?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "5a228d7f",
"en_raw": "Whether Nao can do a backward"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "39089f64",
"en_raw": "pull-up now"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3f524cfa",
"en_raw": "It's the park under the overpass"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "8cf225dc",
"en_raw": "just go down the slope in front of school"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "41345a76",
"en_raw": "and you're there"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "138939d0",
"en_raw": "But I've never seen kids"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "299216a1",
"en_raw": "playing in that park"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "5c9859a2",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "7e6527a9",
"en_raw": "are you scared?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "1816e913",
"en_raw": "It's a lonely park"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "076d8a33",
"en_raw": "Naturally"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b32791ee",
"en_raw": "Because it's about as boring"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "f0136b62",
"en_raw": "as can be"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "ecf38657",
"en_raw": "But, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "c6f2531e",
"en_raw": "there was a sandbox"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "4c909203",
"en_raw": "Yeah, but it's okay..."
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "ba45c072",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't want to"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "79e6d9ff",
"en_raw": "play house"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "477de1d4",
"en_raw": "Play house?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "152e2475",
"en_raw": "So, sandbox another time"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "053c2e38",
"en_raw": "Next time, when That isn't there"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "52362c89",
"en_raw": "we'll go"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "08b8069e",
"en_raw": "Not seeing the red kid and such"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "ab5ada0b",
"en_raw": "is fine, but"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "38fa7f63",
"en_raw": "...how should I put it"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "4b122f60",
"en_raw": "That's a gloomy park"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "41586069",
"en_raw": "Yeah, you don't really feel"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "8aed4680",
"en_raw": "like playing there"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "56c04490",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina, you too, right?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "ede581b1",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "caaefa54",
"en_raw": "The kid in the raincoat"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "0c63cf57",
"en_raw": "wouldn't move"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "f646bd54",
"en_raw": "so Kurumi couldn't play"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "a2bf04aa",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "16984701",
"en_raw": "...There was nobody there"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "21a57954",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to play in the sandbox"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "5850a971",
"en_raw": "Let's go to the park"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "e1cdba2e",
"en_raw": "It looks like nobody dug"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "4fe52633",
"en_raw": "a hole deep enough to die in, but"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7d290067",
"en_raw": "Are you satisfied, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "18cfc632",
"en_raw": "Not satisfied"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "938cf1cd",
"en_raw": "If That is there, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "8e57cc3a",
"en_raw": "can't play at all"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "c3653923",
"en_raw": "Which 'That'?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "72f2a4ee",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't know That"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "45b7aada",
"en_raw": "About That"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "ad5b12b9",
"en_raw": "Jelly-chan said so"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "7cc6d61f",
"en_raw": "...Jelly-chan?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "f6480e65",
"en_raw": "Could that be"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "6df01d58",
"en_raw": "the park triplets thing?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "1eaddd6c",
"en_raw": "Yeah, I guess..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "d567e9b8",
"en_raw": "If you lie, I'll make you swallow"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "ea3968f0",
"en_raw": "10,000 mechanical pencil leads"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "67d7540f",
"en_raw": "Then it's a lie"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "3618e110",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "c5446d97",
"en_raw": "Stop it, Sango"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "70691d92",
"en_raw": "That park is really strange"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "71a051e2",
"en_raw": "There isn't a single kid"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "f5112cb7",
"en_raw": "There aren't many places to play"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "0c1070d7",
"en_raw": "near here, either"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "11020b7a",
"en_raw": "You see"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "89f52936",
"en_raw": "Cookie-chan said"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "e15669e1",
"en_raw": "it's a place you shouldn't go"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "286801c4",
"en_raw": "But the sandbox is only there"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "ac200704",
"en_raw": "There must be some reason"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "953b5177",
"en_raw": "Let's ask them"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "1b01f34a",
"en_raw": "Ask, but who are you going to ask?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "90ad76c7",
"en_raw": "Um... well..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "4b8b3be8",
"en_raw": "It's what Shiina's friend's"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "f4736128",
"en_raw": "little sister said..."
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "84697a5a",
"en_raw": "Kids... or..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "ef4f6b1b",
"en_raw": "Places with kids would be..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "58f1b7be",
"en_raw": "The plaza at my housing estate"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "5a5d200f",
"en_raw": "Near my house, maybe"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "e3b6ddd1",
"en_raw": "Yomogi Nursery School..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "e3bdeb24",
"en_raw": "And Kasuka-chan at the Tama River!"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "2abb742b",
"en_raw": "The reason kids don't play there"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "ad8312db",
"en_raw": "is obvious"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "0475999e",
"en_raw": "...It's boring!"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "55b67d50",
"en_raw": "I don't know what they did, but"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "847fa9b5",
"en_raw": "it seems certain those kids"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "02ff4344",
"en_raw": "did something..."
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "a3799a05",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will ask"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "b2da2bad",
"en_raw": "Acchan"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "4d6b8d07",
"en_raw": "Acchan..."
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "ca43cb51",
"en_raw": "He's surely"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "541ce701",
"en_raw": "the ringleader"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "3368d38a",
"en_raw": "Before we know it, it's an incident"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "207ec227",
"en_raw": "Just because there are no kids"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "a59c7634",
"en_raw": "in the park..."
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "a7eb2f60",
"en_raw": "You're the one who said"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "619cd5a9",
"en_raw": "it was weird first, Nao"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "73536d88",
"en_raw": "A kid waiting for his mom"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "f8a293e4",
"en_raw": "in front of the Yomogi Nursery gate"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "e3becc8c",
"en_raw": "that's Acchan, then"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "43ead1e8",
"en_raw": "...Funeral play"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "d1ece62f",
"en_raw": "So I won't go to that park"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "5b164ae1",
"en_raw": "Hey, what on earth"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "a4bad8c0",
"en_raw": "did those kids do..."
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "ae454aad",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what kind of game"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "af9bcc0b",
"en_raw": "is funeral play?"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "98f19675",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't know"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "dded5ec0",
"en_raw": "Maybe a pet grave or something"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "65cde9b1",
"en_raw": "But those kids' attitude is odd"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "28577aca",
"en_raw": "Just for burying a pet in the sandbox,"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "a278436b",
"en_raw": "saying no or it's a secret,"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "3ed8e2dd",
"en_raw": "would they make such a fuss"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "8dd6d27e",
"en_raw": "and be scared?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "fd335fa5",
"en_raw": "Then what... did they bury?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "2769352f",
"en_raw": "What do you do, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "20bab532",
"en_raw": "Do you have the guts to try?"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "6b477b59",
"en_raw": "If we dig the sandbox and a rotting"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "f15503ce",
"en_raw": "corpse turns up, aaagh"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "f2659db9",
"en_raw": "Shiina, let's give up"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "c6abeca5",
"en_raw": "on the sandbox"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "0be2fa71",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't like it"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "1b19171d",
"en_raw": "So, what do you do, wimp Nao?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "b5ad1591",
"en_raw": "Sango, what are we doing with this doll?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "b56f169f",
"en_raw": "What do we do..."
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "7f95156a",
"en_raw": "Bury it again?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "ff4360bc",
"en_raw": "That's the same thing"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "37f5b758",
"en_raw": "A more proper place..."
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "0cc6668a",
"en_raw": "You're going to rebury it, right?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "c74967fd",
"en_raw": "What's different?"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "3b6a6868",
"en_raw": "Then... um"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "39287e47",
"en_raw": "take it to a temple..."
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "6e67f113",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "27e5e2a7",
"en_raw": "The owner is that kid"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "eb91ba99",
"en_raw": "just give it back"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "23145592",
"en_raw": "They won't accept it"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "cee75608",
"en_raw": "They're the ones who buried it"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "29bbe98c",
"en_raw": "Then what do you want"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "b0091e58",
"en_raw": "us to do?"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "acc435a6",
"en_raw": "I don't know..."
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "f22017c8",
"en_raw": "Then don't talk"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "e50065de",
"en_raw": "Hey hey hey hey"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "fb373037",
"en_raw": "Then can Kurumi have it?"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "6fee7132",
"en_raw": "...Shiina, you"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "a8b85e1f",
"en_raw": "will take this?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "1ac8a82a",
"en_raw": "We should've given it to Shiina"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "5a494f23",
"en_raw": "from the start"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "062458d6",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "b3987e37",
"en_raw": "What happened to that doll?"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "0a56efd5",
"en_raw": "You took it home, right?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "22a8561c",
"en_raw": "Oh, that... no"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "4dc30beb",
"en_raw": "I put it in the trash box"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "a20046de",
"en_raw": "...You threw it away!?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "219855e6",
"en_raw": "I was sure Shiina"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "e141dd5e",
"en_raw": "took it home..."
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "679dc1bd",
"en_raw": "Because I didn't want it"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "e2907928",
"en_raw": "Why!"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "58500d1b",
"en_raw": "Even if it's a doll"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "0a3136dc",
"en_raw": "tossing it in the trash"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "5387c1a9",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi..."
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "6fa20a2c",
"en_raw": "isn't bad..."
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "36349bca",
"en_raw": "I'm surprised"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "0b911016",
"en_raw": "that you'd do something so cruel"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "9b1a2274",
"en_raw": "You shouldn't do that"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "b62d4c87",
"en_raw": "Dolls feel sorry too"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "025fcb62",
"en_raw": "What a fine sermon"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "1c5160ee",
"en_raw": "Don't throw cold water"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "21fc02c0",
"en_raw": "I'm being serious"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "3f3df354",
"en_raw": "I'm talking to you!"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "12049f92",
"en_raw": "Poor thing, poor thing"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "30f0c367",
"en_raw": "So, Nao"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "72abca90",
"en_raw": "what did you do?"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "f0b5cf83",
"en_raw": "You were just scared and watching"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "61b77097",
"en_raw": "I wasn't scared..."
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "8c618011",
"en_raw": "Anyway, the one who settled it"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "46e17b22",
"en_raw": "was Shiina"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "b5ad86c4",
"en_raw": "What serious talk"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "0b0df63b",
"en_raw": "Who do you think you are?"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "eae39459",
"en_raw": "Blabbing only emotions"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "9e14bb61",
"en_raw": "someone who does nothing"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "7ec3b6e3",
"en_raw": "is the worst of all"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "59eae8dc",
"en_raw": "....."
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "137c9e74",
"en_raw": "You did good, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "1d8daf03",
"en_raw": "You've got much better judgment"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "9c6ad0a3",
"en_raw": "than that idiot Nao"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "0647691d",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "4b200a55",
"en_raw": "didn't want it..."
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "1bf61ae6",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Park Triplets"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "f8f5d684",
